:: Prison Wren Intro
<<effects>>

<<He>> reaches into <<his>> pocket, and produces a white, translucent gem between thumb and forefinger. "We call these shark's teeth," <<he>> says. "The birds here fish them from the water. Sometimes they end up down here."
<br><br>

<<He>> puts the tooth away. "If you find some, <span class="gold">find me in the yard on Fridays, after lunch.</span>" <<He>> smiles. "I'll make it worth your while."
<br><br>

<<if $phase is "intro">>
	<<set $wren_intro to true>>
	<span class="gold">"The name's Wren,"</span> <<he>> says as <<he>> brushes past you. "Until we meet again."
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if isPubfameTaskAccepted("wren") and !$pubfame.seen.includes("prisonWren")>>
	<<set $pubfame.seen.pushUnique("prisonWren")>>
	<<= $phase is "intro" ? "This is the person that 'Mickey' wanted you to deliver the letter to." : "'Mickey' wanted you to deliver the letter to Wren.">> However, <span class="red">the guards confiscated the letter alongside your personal belongings.</span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Prison Yard]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren
<<effects>>

<<npc "Wren">><<person1>>
렌이 당신을 보고 미소 짓는다. "이빨을 가져왔다면," <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "바깥세상에서 온 좋은 물건들이 좀 있지."
<br><br>

<span class="gold">당신은 상어 이빨<<icon "tending/sharks-teeth.png">><<number $prison.teeth>>개 가지고 있습니다.</span>
<br><br>

<<prisonicon "clothing">><<link [[의류 선택|Prison Wren Clothes]]>><</link>>
<br><br>

<<if !$prison.hammer>>
	작은 망치: 이빨 <span class="gold">20</span>개
	<br>
	<<if $prison.teeth gte 20>>
		<<prisonicon "hammer">><<link [[구매|Prison Wren Hammer]]>><<prison_teeth -20>><<set $prison.hammer to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">이빨이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $prison.mirror isnot 1>>
	거울: 이빨 <span class="gold">30</span>개
	<br>
	<<if $prison.teeth gte 30>>
		<<prisonicon "mirror">><<link [[구매|Prison Wren Mirror]]>><<prison_teeth -30>><<set $prison.mirror to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">이빨이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $prison.code isnot 1>>
	의무실 잠긴 방의 암호: 이빨 <span class="gold">50</span>개
	<br>
	<<if $prison.teeth gte 50>>
		<<prisonicon "code">><<link [[구매|Prison Wren Code]]>><<prison_teeth -50>><<set $prison.code to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">이빨이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $prison.poster isnot "man">>
	섹시한 신사 포스터: 이빨 <span class="gold">50</span>개
	<br>
	<<if $prison.teeth gte 50>>
		<<prisonicon "man">><<link [[구매|Prison Wren Poster]]>><<set $poster_choice to "man">><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">이빨이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $prison.poster isnot "woman">>
	섹시한 숙녀 포스터: 이빨 <span class="gold">50</span>개
	<br>
	<<if $prison.teeth gte 50>>
		<<prisonicon "woman">><<link [[구매|Prison Wren Poster]]>><<set $poster_choice to "woman">><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">이빨이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $prison.poster isnot "puppy">>
	귀여운 강아지 포스터: 이빨 <span class="gold">50</span>개
	<br>
	<<if $prison.teeth gte 50>>
		<<prisonicon "puppy">><<link [[구매|Prison Wren Poster]]>><<set $poster_choice to "puppy">><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">이빨이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if !$prison.rope>>
	밧줄: 이빨 <span class="gold">100</span>개
	<br>
	<<if $prison.teeth gte 100>>
		<<prisonicon "rope">><<link [[구매|Prison Wren Rope]]>><<prison_teeth -100>><<set $prison.rope to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">이빨이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $prison.yard_key is 1 and $prison.yard_door is 1>>
	당신은 더 이상 큰 쇠 열쇠를 쓸 일이 없습니다. 렌이 이빨 <span class="gold">200</span>개를 주겠다고 제안합니다.
	<br>
	<<lockicon "iron key">><<link [[판매|Prison Wren Yard Key]]>><<set $prison.yard_key to 0>><<prison_teeth 200>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[탈출에 대해 묻는다|Prison Wren Ask]]>><</link>>
<br><br>

<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Prison Yard]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Clothes
<<set $wardrobe_location to "prison">>
<<wardrobeSelection true>>
<<set _clothingInfo = [
		{
			index:1,
			name:"panties",
			category:"under_lower",
			teeth:5,
		},
		{
			index:4,
			name:"briefs",
			category:"under_lower",
			teeth:5,
		},
		{
			index:12,
			name:"bra",
			category:"under_upper",
			teeth:5,
		},
		{
			index:22,
			name:"vest",
			category:"under_upper",
			teeth:5,
		},
		{
			index:85,
			name:"shirt",
			category:"upper",
			teeth:10,
		},
		{
			index:77,
			name:"trousers",
			category:"lower",
			teeth:10,
		},
		{
			index:86,
			name:"jumpsuit",
			category:"upper",
			teeth:15,
		},
	]>>
<<if $pickedColor is undefined>>
	<<set $pickedColor = {}>>

	<<for _i, _item range _clothingInfo>>
		<<set _colorOptions = setup.clothes[_item.category].find(ele => ele.index === _item.index).colour_options.filter(item => item !== "custom");>>
		<<set _rngPickedColor = _colorOptions[Math.floor(Math.random() * _colorOptions.length)]>>
		<<set $pickedColor[_item.name] = _rngPickedColor>>
	<</for>>
<</if>>
<<set _colorClass = function(color) {
	if (color !== undefined) return "icon-" + color.replace(" ", "-");
}>>

<span class="gold">당신은 상어 이빨<<icon "tending/sharks-teeth.png">><<number $prison.teeth>>개 가지고 있습니다.</span>
<br><br>

<<for _i, _item range _clothingInfo>>
	<<set _iconFile = setup.clothes[_item.category].find(ele => ele.index === _item.index).iconFile>>
	<<set _icon to "clothes/"+_iconFile>>
	<<set _negTeeth to -_item.teeth>>
	<span class="capitalize"><<= ({ panties: "팬티", briefs: "삼각팬티", bra: "브라", vest: "런닝셔츠", shirt: "셔츠", trousers: "바지", jumpsuit: "점프수트" }[_item.name] || _item.name) >></span>: 이빨 <span class="gold">_item.teeth</span>개
	<br>
	<<if $prison.teeth gte _item.teeth>>
		<span @class="_colorClass($pickedColor[_item.name])"><<icon _icon>></span>
		<<capture _item _negTeeth _iconName>>
			<<link [[구매|Prison Wren Clothes Buy]]>>
				<<set $phase to _item.name>>
				<<prison_teeth _negTeeth>>
				<<switch _item.category>>
					<<case "under_lower">>
						<<underlowersend _item.index $wardrobe_location $pickedColor[_item.name]>>
					<<case "under_upper">>
						<<underuppersend _item.index $wardrobe_location $pickedColor[_item.name]>>
					<<case "lower">>
						<<lowersend _item.index $wardrobe_location>>
					<<case "upper">>
						<<uppersend _item.index $wardrobe_location>>
				<</switch>>
			<</link>>
		<</capture>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">이빨이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</for>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Prison Wren]]>><<unset $pickedColor>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Clothes Buy
<<effects>>
<<npc Wren>><<person1>>
<<switch $phase>>
	<<case "panties" "briefs">>
		"They'll be sent to your cell," Wren says. "I don't think the staff even bother to order their own. Everyone comes to me."
	<<case "bra" "vest">>
		"It'll be sent to your cell," Wren says. "I'm basically an underwear <<= $pronoun is "m" ? "salesman" : "saleswoman">>."
	<<case "shirt">>
		"It'll be sent to your cell," Wren says. "I like the old-fashioned style. Might be why I enjoy the estate so much."
	<<case "trousers">>
		"They'll be sent to your cell," Wren says. "Don't worry if they get a little muddy."
	<<case "jumpsuit">>
		"It'll be sent to your cell," Wren says. "I hear the prison has a ton of these, but they only give the one to newcomers."
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Prison Wren Clothes]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Code
<<effects>><<wearProp "paper note">>

렌이 네 자리 숫자가 적힌 쪽지를 건네준다. "거기에 뭘 보관하는지는 몰라." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "하지만 중요한 거겠지. 들키지 않게 조심해. 만약 잡히면, 우린 만난 적 없는 거야."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Wren]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Rope
<<effects>><<wearProp "rope">>

"튼튼하고 길지." 렌이 말한다. <<he>>【은는】 뭔가 더 말하고 싶어 하는 것 같지만, 능글맞은 미소로 만족하는 듯하다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Wren]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Yard Key
<<effects>><<wearProp "shark tooth">>

렌이 이빨을 건네준다. "여분으로 가지고 있으면 좋지." <<He>>【이가】 미소 짓는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Wren]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Mirror
<<effects>>

렌이 반사되는 유리 조각을 건네준다. "가장자리 조심해." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "난 붕대는 안 가지고 다니거든."
<br><br>

<span class="gold">이제 거울을 가지고 있습니다. 감옥에서 사용할 수 있습니다.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Wren]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Hammer
<<effects>><<wearProp "tiny hammer">>

렌이 당신의 엄지손가락만 한 작은 망치를 건네준다. "더 큰 걸 기대한 건 아니겠지." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "내가 좋아하는 걸 아무거나 가져올 순 없거든."
<br><br>

<span class="gold">이제 작은 망치를 가지고 있습니다.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Wren]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Poster
<<effects>><<wearProp "rolled poster">>

<<if $prison.poster and $phase isnot 1>>
	"이전 건 내가 다시 가져갈게." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "호의라고 생각해. 장식이 너무 많으면 구경꾼들이 꼬이거든."
	<br><br>

	<<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 손바닥에서 이빨을 굴린다. "아직 마음 있어?"
	<br><br>

	<<link [[포스터 교체하기|Prison Wren Poster]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[그만둔다|Prison Wren]]>><<unset $poster_choice>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	"네 감옥에 걸어두라고 할게." 렌이 말한다. "무료로."
	<br><br>

	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<span class="gold">감옥 벽의 포스터가 교체되었습니다.</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="gold">이제 감옥 벽에 포스터가 있습니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Prison Wren]]>><<prison_teeth -50>><<set $prison.poster to $poster_choice>><<unset $poster_choice>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Prison Wren Ask
<<effects>>
<<generate_relaxed_guard 1>>
"여기서 탈출하는 사람은 없어." 렌이 말한다. "안개를 뚫고 배를 조종할 수 있는 사람은 단 한 명뿐인데, <<person2>>【은는】 용병이 아니야. 감시자들은 수영하는 사람들을 주시하고 있고. 어차피 물에 닿을 수도 없으니 상관없지만. 시스템이 널 처리할 때까지 기다리는 게 최선이야. 그동안 괜히 주목받지 말고."
<br><br>
<<person1>>
"그렇긴 해도," <<he>>【이가】 말을 잇는다. "만약 네가 물에 닿을 수 있고, 새들이 널 막을 의지가 없거나 막을 수 없다면, 수영을 잘하는 사람은 해낼 수 있을지도 몰라." <<He>>【이가】 어깨를 으쓱한다. "생각만 해도 재밌네."
<br><br>

<<link [[어떻게 드나드는지 묻는다|Prison Wren Ask 2]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[떠난다|Prison Wren]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Ask 2
<<effects>>

렌이 미소 짓는다. "그건 <<= $prison_wren_boat_intro is 1 ? "나만의" : "우리만의">> 비밀이야."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Wren]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
